  "description": "Raw Power, Tamed by Intelligence:\nA heavy-duty 750W (1000W Peak) motor delivers smooth, unrelenting power to flatten city inclines, perfectly governed by an advanced Torque Sensor for instant, lag-free assistance that reads your mind.\n\nMassive 90-Mile Freedom: Packed with a high-capacity 48V 20Ah (960Wh) premium battery seamlessly hidden in the frame. Commute all week on a single charge and completely wipe out range anxiety.\n\nFrame-Embedded Smart Console: Ditch the cluttered handlebar displays. Urban X features a flush, top-tube integrated LED display seamlessly embedded directly into the frame for a pure stealth aesthetic, backed by Apple Find My™ tracking.\n\nElite Mechanical Foundation: Conquer any road condition with confidence using premium hydraulic disc brakes for crisp stopping power, an adjustable lockout suspension fork, and a Shimano 7-speed drivetrain.\n\nAll-Weather Utility & 360° Safety: Fully equipped for the daily grind with a heavy-duty 66 lbs cargo rack, full-coverage fenders, and an automotive-grade lighting system featuring integrated brake and rear turn signals.",
